Z||000008||mrfiero||06-25-2001||09:05 PM||||That is nasty!  I only hope the second guy was already dead before he hit the post.  According to the caption they were doing about 280 KPH, which (if I did my math right) was almost 175 MPH.  That meant the second guy hit that post at a VERY high rate of speed.  <P>This reminds me of a junkyard I go to here in Colorado......they post accident photos (from the state patrol) on a bulletin board in front of the entrance.  Some of them are just as disturbing as the ones posted here.<P>One photo showed a car with no roof (drove under a semi)......I couldn't tell what I was looking at until it dawned on me......I was looking at the two front seat passengers sans heads!!  Very disgusting, to say the least.<P><p>[This message has been edited by mrfiero (edited 06-25-2001).]||||reg||1
