Z||000018||AkursedX||06-25-2001||11:24 PM||||Hmmm.....Pretty Cool.  But that's what you get when you drive that fast.  And yes, wearing seatbelts mught of kept them in the car, but I bet they still would be dead.  There isn't much that'll save you when you crash into something at 175mph!<P>And sjp777, I am assuming you are a linguistics expert huh?  Quite a useful little talent  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sig_pic.jpg"> ||||reg||1
