Z||000029||Steve Normington||06-26-2001||11:32 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by SteveJ:<BR><B> Bet you mean inertial, right?</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>There are both centrifugal and inertial belt locking systems. Centrifugal works when the belt is extracted quickly. Inertial works when the car decelerates quickly.||||reg||1
